<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title><%= title %></title>
<%- headHTML %>
<% if (sdkPlacement === 'head') { %><script src="<%= sdkURL %>"></script><% } %>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:12px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182132;font:14px system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:560px;margin:auto;padding:16px;background:white;border:1px solid #d9e0e9;border-radius:10px}
h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:20px}p{line-height:1.5}dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:105px 1fr;gap:6px;margin:12px 0}
dt{color:#5b6575}dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}pre{margin:0;font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap}
.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}button{min-height:42px;border:1px solid #bdc8d8;border-radius:6px;background:#f7f9fc;font:inherit}
#download{background:#2264d8;color:white;border-color:#2264d8}button:disabled{opacity:.5}
#error{padding:10px;background:#fff0f0;color:#a31919;border:1px solid #efb8b8}
#events{height:30vh;min-height:120px;overflow:auto;padding:10px;background:#172234;color:#d9e8ff;border-radius:6px}
.note{font-size:12px;color:#5b6575;margin-bottom:0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1><%= title %> · <%= channelName %></h1>
<p id="error" role="alert" hidden></p>
<dl>
<dt>channel</dt><dd id="channel">等待初始化</dd>
<dt>ready</dt><dd id="ready">—</dd>
<dt>viewable</dt><dd id="viewable">—</dd>
<dt>muted（回调）</dt><dd id="muted">等待回调</dd>
<dt>监听状态</dt><dd id="listening">等待初始化</dd>
<dt>capabilities</dt><dd><pre id="capabilities">—</pre></dd>
</dl>
<div class="controls">
<button id="download" disabled>下载 · openStore()</button>
<button id="finish" disabled>结束 · finish()</button>
<button id="read" disabled>读取状态</button>
<button id="unsubscribe" disabled>取消监听</button>
<button id="subscribe" disabled>重新监听</button>
</div>
<p>事件与调用记录</p>
<pre id="events" aria-live="polite"></pre>
<p class="note">切换容器可见性或静音状态，观察回调。重复点击结束可检查去重。下载调用返回后，请在平台上确认实际跳转。</p>
</main>
<% if (sdkPlacement !== 'head') { %><script src="<%= sdkURL %>"></script><% } %>
<% if (runtimeCode === null) { %><script data-playable-runtime src="./playable-runtime.js"></script><% } else { %><script data-playable-runtime><%- runtimeCode %></script><% } %>
</body>
</html>
